<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109178" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσπείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sow, implant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραπίδεσσι πόθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Melanipp.
					7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔασι μειλιχίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.33
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leont.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; <i>introduce, interweave,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγους Πλάτωνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Dio</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανομήκεις ἐλπίδας ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.251
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to have plants sown in the midst,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοινικὼν -όμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CPR</u>
					45.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				5670.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <i>to be overspread,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζαις ὑπεσπαρμένον λεπταῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεύματα ὑπέσπαρται ἐν τῷ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cass.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			.</div>
